Attribution for forks and derivative works based on this design
------------------------------------------------------------------

If you use this design (tokens, specifications, prototype or interface
assets) in your project — or in a fork of Organic Maps — include a visible,
human-readable mention of the "Organic Maps Project" together with a
clickable link to https://organicmaps.app. The notice should appear in
user-visible locations such as the product's "About" and "Main Menu"
screens.

This mirrors the attribution requirement of the Organic Maps project itself
and applies to any derivative application built with these materials.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Map data
---------

No map data (.mwm files), tiles or other binary geographic datasets are
distributed in this repository. The map styling values included here are
design tokens only. The data itself is licensed separately by the
OpenStreetMap Foundation and by the Organic Maps project; see
DATA_LICENSE.txt in the main Organic Maps repository.
